| Category | Tools |
|----------|-------|
| Model | Qwen-7B |
| Fine-tuning | QLoRA (4-bit), LoRA via `peft` |
| Framework | Hugging Face Transformers |
| Data | Python, Pandas, SVG parsing |
| Hardware | A100 GPU (Kaggle environment) |

