---

## Key Learnings

- QLoRA makes fine-tuning 7B models feasible on a single consumer/research GPU
- Data quality (SVG canonicalization + validation) matters more than training duration for structured output tasks
- Prompt formatting significantly impacts how well the model learns the SVG generation task

